% Scenario: arcs in a user path. arc and arcn may open a subpath, and
% arct takes the place of arcto; the box encloses each arc's figure
% (its ends and the axis extremes it sweeps through). The second page
% draws the same shapes by hand.
{0 0 200 200 setbbox
 50 50 40 0 360 arc closepath
 150 50 30 180 0 arcn closepath
 100 120 moveto 140 120 140 160 20 arct 140 190 lineto} ufill
showpage
50 50 40 0 360 arc closepath
150 50 30 180 0 arcn closepath
100 120 moveto 140 120 140 160 20 arcto pop pop pop pop 140 190 lineto
fill
showpage
